infographic compare-binary-horizontal-underline-text-vs
data
  title The assert-rewrite boundary
  desc pytest AST-rewrites only what it imports for collection — everything else raises bare
  compares
    - label Rewritten — rich introspection
      children
        - label test_*.py / *_test.py
          desc Every assert shows each subexpression value
        - label conftest.py
          desc Rewritten automatically, no opt-in needed
        - label Registered plugins
          desc Rewritten when pytest imports them
    - label Not rewritten — bare AssertionError
      children
        - label tests/helpers.py
          desc Shared checks raise with no values
        - label Any imported, non-collected module
          desc Outside the import hook's reach
        - label Fix: register_assert_rewrite()
          desc Call in conftest before the first import
theme
  palette #14b8a6 #f43f5e
